<pretext>
  <article>
    <title>(Linear) Transformers: Matrices in Disguise</title>

    <section>
      <title>Quick Span Review</title>

      <p>Play the following game: <url href="https://alexblackmath.github.io/games/lineartransformations.html" visual="alexblackmath.github.io/games/lineartransformations.html">Linear Transformations Game</url>.</p>

      <!--
